        <briefdescription>
<para>Drain all tenant queues by calling <ref refid="classthemis_1_1gpu_1_1_g_p_u_time_slice_scheduler_1aabc734f3b81334e64010af7ae2b0d2a1" kindref="member">dispatch()</ref> until empty. </para>
